   "t": "Не надо, Самсон. Сейчас придёт охрана.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Проводите его, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Передумаешь — приходи. Должность ждёт.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "That's it for this part: a childhood promise, kept after thirty years. When you watch the episode, listen for Arkady's calm reply about remembering everything; you'll catch it now. See you next time!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
